  "e.free.settled1": "settled, stopped on its own · {it}/{max} iterations · residual {res} (the mask-quantisation jitter floor; the answer has stopped moving — T-M16\u2019s third verdict, neither success nor failure)",
  "e.free.settled": "{nset}/{n} solves settled and stopped on their own, the rest converged · last {it}/{max} iterations · residual {res}",
