  "e.free.bad": "★<strong>did not converge</strong> · {nbad} of {n} solves missed it · first at block {blk}: {it}/{max} iterations, residual {res} &gt; tolerance {tol}",
  "e.verdict.freebad": "★★<strong>This march used a free-boundary equilibrium that did not converge</strong>: {nbad} of {n} solves failed to reach the tolerance, the first at block {blk} — {it}/{max} iterations, residual {res} against a tolerance of {tol}. Every profile, every q and every volume average below is read off that psi map; raise the iteration cap before reading them. ★Raising it often does not fix it: the droop trim needs thousands of iterations, and at that point the number to watch is the residual itself rather than the count.",

