  "e.geo_note": "★These numbers and the picture beside them have one source: the <strong>geometry</strong> tier, not the shape controls. Only the analytic tier is shaped by the sliders; point the bar at a solved equilibrium or an imported g-file and both the shape and the field come from that psi map.",
