  "e.verdict.capped": "★It ran the full {n} steps (t = {t} s) rather than stopping steady: that is \"time was up\", not \"it settled\" — read the traces and dW/dt before calling it a steady state.",
  "e.cost_note": "{n} steps, about <strong>{s} seconds</strong> at the measured cost per step (coupling cadence K = {k}; each equilibrium re-solve is a further ≈0.78 s). The bill is stated before you pay it.",

  "e.wave": "Waveform (discharge phases)",
  "e.wave.on": "March on a waveform (off = constant throughout)",
